# Line endings are normalised to LF everywhere, including the working copy on
# Windows. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks these files out with CRLF
# while Prettier writes LF, so `npm run format:check` would fail on every file
# on a Windows machine and pass in CI, which runs on Linux. A formatting gate
# that only fails on one of the two is worse than no gate at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never rewrite line endings inside a binary file.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
